    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 54560,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "小三拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 55420,
      "end_ms": 57099,
      "text": "它归根结底是法权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 60340,
      "end_ms": 62520,
      "text": "你头脑里面想没想没"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 62520,
      "end_ms": 64620,
      "text": "我们说反对的是小三拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 64620,
      "end_ms": 66980,
      "text": "不是反对的是你这三种行动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 69080,
      "end_ms": 70200,
      "text": "理解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 70640,
      "end_ms": 75080,
      "text": "你们这个真的是从法权角度来讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 75080,
      "end_ms": 78320,
      "text": "这三种东西不需要额外用法权来定义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 79060,
      "end_ms": 80160,
      "text": "这三种东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 80160,
      "end_ms": 81300,
      "text": "它现实的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 81300,
      "end_ms": 82899,
      "text": "当然它现实的存在啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 83220,
      "end_ms": 86070,
      "text": "如果用法权来定义这三种东西的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 90580,
      "end_ms": 91740,
      "text": "你们想清楚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 91740,
      "end_ms": 92490,
      "text": "小三拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 92490,
      "end_ms": 94050,
      "text": "小三拳本身只是全"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 94050,
      "end_ms": 95500,
      "text": "它不是现实"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 97320,
      "end_ms": 100640,
      "text": "我从来没有说反对这三种斗争现实啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 101020,
      "end_ms": 105040,
      "text": "三种斗争手段小赚钱本身不是斗争手段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 105040,
      "end_ms": 108679,
      "text": "他只是说把你这三种斗争手段给合法化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 108760,
      "end_ms": 112780,
      "text": "你要追求的不是说要把这三种斗争手段合法化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 112780,
      "end_ms": 115600,
      "text": "你要追求的就是这三种斗争手段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 115600,
      "end_ms": 117060,
      "text": "实现它的斗争目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 118140,
      "end_ms": 119780,
      "text": "三种斗争手段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 119780,
      "end_ms": 124080,
      "text": "难道仅仅是要让自己这作为三种手段合法化吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 124120,
      "end_ms": 126460,
      "text": "而他的目的其实不能实现吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 126460,
      "end_ms": 128259,
      "text": "他的目的不就是大三权吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 128259,
      "end_ms": 129940,
      "text": "他的目的不就是生存权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 132179,
      "end_ms": 133039,
      "text": "生存权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 133039,
      "end_ms": 133519,
      "text": "发展权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 135210,
      "end_ms": 135990,
      "text": "法律层面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 135990,
      "end_ms": 137010,
      "text": "在法权层面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 137010,
      "end_ms": 139350,
      "text": "在整个根本性的政治制度层面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 139350,
      "end_ms": 140470,
      "text": "得到一个保障的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 140470,
      "end_ms": 143020,
      "text": "你才能说你的生存和发展和解放"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 148100,
      "end_ms": 151500,
      "text": "请问你是否明白我这一点观点了吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 152559,
      "end_ms": 156209,
      "text": "我从我没有说要反对自发斗争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 156209,
      "end_ms": 157019,
      "text": "恰恰相反"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 157019,
      "end_ms": 160520,
      "text": "你要去引导统领自发斗争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 163430,
      "end_ms": 166130,
      "text": "这些自发斗争应当去阳气"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 166130,
      "end_ms": 168110,
      "text": "其自发性去引导他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 168110,
      "end_ms": 169329,
      "text": "就要去指挥他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 169329,
      "end_ms": 170889,
      "text": "你要引导你要指挥他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 170889,
      "end_ms": 172449,
      "text": "你不能等着它发生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 172449,
      "end_ms": 173630,
      "text": "然后再去怎么样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 173630,
      "end_ms": 174590,
      "text": "你要引导他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 174590,
      "end_ms": 175850,
      "text": "你要指指挥他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 175850,
      "end_ms": 178370,
      "text": "甚至说你要我们不说诱导吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 178370,
      "end_ms": 180589,
      "text": "你要顺应他啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 180589,
      "end_ms": 181699,
      "text": "你要驾驭他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 181699,
      "end_ms": 183400,
      "text": "不让他走向工团主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 185260,
      "end_ms": 188100,
      "text": "说认为劳动者真正的保障在于大3000"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 188100,
      "end_ms": 189270,
      "text": "怎么实现大三权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 191310,
      "end_ms": 194420,
      "text": "掌握根本制度的定义权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 194700,
      "end_ms": 199690,
      "text": "大三拳的实现不是生存发展解放的实现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 199690,
      "end_ms": 200860,
      "text": "而是生存权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 200860,
