    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 365239,
      "end_ms": 366709,
      "text": "可能就受教育水平差"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 366709,
      "end_ms": 369630,
      "text": "可能这个人就是说头脑简单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 369630,
      "end_ms": 370740,
      "text": "不代表我看不起他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 370740,
      "end_ms": 371940,
      "text": "他如果是个劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 371940,
      "end_ms": 373020,
      "text": "是个一线劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 374640,
      "end_ms": 375909,
      "text": "我还是看得上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 375909,
      "end_ms": 379340,
      "text": "否则我不会说在视频里面这样去回应他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 379460,
      "end_ms": 380450,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 380450,
      "end_ms": 384090,
      "text": "我不会说我把我彻彻底底的观点说出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 384090,
      "end_ms": 385890,
      "text": "这个都是冒政治风险的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 385890,
      "end_ms": 387390,
      "text": "在互联网上公开讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 387390,
      "end_ms": 389670,
      "text": "这些东西都是冒我政治风险的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 389670,
      "end_ms": 391380,
      "text": "不仅冒我一个人政治风险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 394500,
      "end_ms": 397280,
      "text": "现在你明白了什么叫做反对小三钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 397280,
      "end_ms": 398440,
      "text": "争取大三拳啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 398500,
      "end_ms": 401560,
      "text": "反对的是这个全是这个合法性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 401560,
      "end_ms": 402500,
      "text": "网开一面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 402500,
      "end_ms": 403760,
      "text": "我不要你网开一面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 403760,
      "end_ms": 404840,
      "text": "你网开一面有用啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 404840,
      "end_ms": 405380,
      "text": "你骗我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 405380,
      "end_ms": 408180,
      "text": "你你同意我反抗你神经神经病"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 408940,
      "end_ms": 410760,
      "text": "我争取的是这个拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 410760,
      "end_ms": 412799,
      "text": "而且我争取的是这个大三拳"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 412799,
      "end_ms": 414179,
      "text": "大山前的意思是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 414179,
      "end_ms": 416279,
      "text": "我不是说要让你同意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 416279,
      "end_ms": 418390,
      "text": "我可以怎么怎么反对你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 418390,
      "end_ms": 423260,
      "text": "而是说我要直接要能够成为制度的制定者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 423479,
      "end_ms": 425849,
      "text": "我要骑到你头上来定义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 430620,
      "end_ms": 435260,
      "text": "生存和发展解放的种种的种种的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 435260,
      "end_ms": 437870,
      "text": "种种的这个根本性的一个保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 437870,
      "end_ms": 439880,
      "text": "都注册实现方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 439880,
      "end_ms": 442250,
      "text": "都注册到你的法权体系当中来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 442250,
      "end_ms": 445310,
      "text": "大三前是非常明确的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 450210,
      "end_ms": 452180,
      "text": "根本性制度的制定权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 452180,
      "end_ms": 454520,
      "text": "这个意味的劳动者要真正的获得这个意味"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 458450,
      "end_ms": 459860,
      "text": "对我网开一面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 460219,
      "end_ms": 462979,
      "text": "让我有某些合法的反抗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 466760,
      "end_ms": 468140,
      "text": "我靠我都反抗了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 468140,
      "end_ms": 469880,
      "text": "我需要你确认我合法干什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 469880,
      "end_ms": 470700,
      "text": "神经病"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 471819,
      "end_ms": 473879,
      "text": "然后说未明子认为"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 473879,
      "end_ms": 476220,
      "text": "劳动者真正的保障在于大三权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 483139,
      "end_ms": 485379,
      "text": "啊真正保障在于大三权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 486699,
      "end_ms": 488480,
      "text": "那么怎么实现大产权呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 488480,
      "end_ms": 489620,
      "text": "说我是个江湖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 489620,
      "end_ms": 490460,
      "text": "用于开出药方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 490460,
      "end_ms": 492800,
      "text": "就是在工业区搞工艺哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 492800,
      "end_ms": 494690,
      "text": "我没有说在工业区搞工业啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 494690,
      "end_ms": 497420,
      "text": "我说是在工业区周边搞工业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 497440,
      "end_ms": 501100,
      "text": "这个这个就是各方面单位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 501100,
      "end_ms": 501760,
      "text": "请注意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 501760,
      "end_ms": 503800,
      "text": "我并没有说在工业区搞工业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 508090,
      "end_ms": 511180,
      "text": "不是这个不是前面这个工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 511180,
      "end_ms": 513100,
      "text": "我们覆盖的不是那种老弱病残"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 513100,
      "end_ms": 514059,
      "text": "或者说小字人间级"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 514059,
      "end_ms": 516460,
      "text": "我们覆盖的就是这个啊工人群"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 516460,
      "end_ms": 517659,
      "text": "就是后面那个弓"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 519380,
      "end_ms": 521359,
      "text": "啊就是后面那个弓啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 523900,
      "end_ms": 525330,
      "text": "就是后面那个工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 525330,
      "end_ms": 528990,
      "text": "给工人提供廉价的这个饮食和住宿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 528990,
      "end_ms": 531090,
      "text": "并创办更加人性化的工厂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 531090,
      "end_ms": 532170,
      "text": "把剩余价值集中起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 533610,
      "end_ms": 534750,
      "text": "说是我实践策略"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 534750,
      "end_ms": 537099,
      "text": "我从来不是说这是我的实践策略啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 538260,
      "end_ms": 540380,
      "text": "提供我没有说提供廉价饮食啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 540380,
      "end_ms": 542220,
      "text": "我说提供免费饮食"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 542220,
      "end_ms": 543180,
      "text": "不要钱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 543180,
      "end_ms": 544590,
      "text": "归根结底是不要钱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 544590,
      "end_ms": 546000,
      "text": "我自己能力有限"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 546000,
      "end_ms": 548850,
      "text": "我只能做一个星期免费一天住宿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 548850,
      "end_ms": 549360,
      "text": "我也说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 549360,
      "end_ms": 551740,
      "text": "是终身免费注册"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 551920,
      "end_ms": 553060,
      "text": "你要实现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 553060,
      "end_ms": 555000,
      "text": "你要实现免费餐饮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 555000,
      "end_ms": 556320,
      "text": "免费的饮食"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 556320,
      "end_ms": 558660,
      "text": "你要实现终身免费宿舍"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 558660,
      "end_ms": 560880,
      "text": "这最后背后都隐含了一个前提条件"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 560880,
      "end_ms": 564069,
      "text": "你要获得绝对的经济权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 564069,
      "end_ms": 565629,
      "text": "压倒性的经济优势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 565629,
      "end_ms": 567189,
      "text": "压倒性的政治优势"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 567189,
      "end_ms": 569520,
      "text": "这是我开出的药方"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 570780,
      "end_ms": 573359,
      "text": "所以我呼吁政府"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 573980,
      "end_ms": 576760,
      "text": "他是有压倒性的经济政治优势的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 576760,
      "end_ms": 578680,
      "text": "我呼吁他嘛啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 578680,
      "end_ms": 584010,
      "text": "我呼吁他就是说要在政策上要确定一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 584010,
      "end_ms": 585150,
      "text": "我呼吁他做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 585150,
      "end_ms": 585930,
      "text": "他做不做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 585930,
      "end_ms": 587610,
      "text": "这个不能怪到我头上来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 587610,
      "end_ms": 588120,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 588120,
      "end_ms": 588990,
      "text": "他做不做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 588990,
      "end_ms": 592260,
      "text": "不就是说要给工人提供免费的饮食"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 595440,
      "end_ms": 597180,
      "text": "公社化免费饮食"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 597180,
      "end_ms": 598140,
      "text": "免费住宿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 598200,
      "end_ms": 599280,
      "text": "免费餐饮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 599280,
      "end_ms": 600150,
      "text": "免费住宿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 600150,
      "end_ms": 604859,
      "text": "让工人的议价权得到一个真正的一个保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 605500,
      "end_ms": 609570,
      "text": "就反正就是一个压倒性的经济的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 609570,
      "end_ms": 613040,
      "text": "政治的力量来让工人能够做到这一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 613100,
      "end_ms": 616310,
      "text": "那这个压倒性的力量目前来说是我们的政府"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 616310,
      "end_ms": 617600,
      "text": "那我呼吁他这样做"
